(text "Hot / cold comparison and fail-disabled enable" (at 228.6 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 80850ac6-8338-5f07-9459-66813c7f277b))
(text "Fixed BQ TS bias" (at 25.4 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d96afc5e-e4fd-527b-80f5-bae61731d9c8))
(text "TH1 is an electrically insulated OFF-BOARD 103AT-2, bonded to the cell. Open/short probe disables charging.\nU12 open-drain outputs both release only within the temperature window. U13 then drives CE low.\nR61/C35 delay charge enable at USB startup; R62 limits capacitor discharge into U12. No ESP32 dependency.\nR60 intentionally replaces the direct TS thermistor. This independent circuit now decides cell charge temperature.\nTolerance calculation uses the NTC beta model: verify actual resistance-temperature curve and trip limits on a fixture." (at 25.4 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid cdcd9370-e774-50b5-a7c6-94d19653449f))
